### Architecture

### Quickstart

#### Prerequisites:

- Install [uv](https://docs.astral.sh/uv/getting-started/installation/) for package management.
- Install [postgres](https://formulae.brew.sh/formula/postgresql@16)

#### Spin up locally:

```
# Create the database
brew services start postgresql@16
psql -d postgres -c 'CREATE DATABASE espressogg'
# Echo into `.env` variables
# ...
# Run postgres migrations
cd backend/
uv sync --active
uv run alembic upgrade head
# Run Terraform infrastructure (remote state, Cloudflare R2)
cd infra/root/
terraform init
terraform apply
cd ..
cd site_assets/
terraform init
terraform workspace new dev
terraform apply
# Grab some initial data locally
uv run python3 pipeline/refresh.py
# Start FastAPI service
uv run fastapi dev
```
